               "LEVEL 1 - Analyze (predict, simulate, board, biascheck)\n"
               "LEVEL 2 - Draft (emails, reports, code - nothing sent/run)\n"
               "LEVEL 3 - Reversible actions (files, reminders, sheets)\n"
