# Root fix: v13.26 Publisher treated EVERY analytical PDF as a current-evidence
# intelligence report. Astrology/personalized/timeless reports therefore failed
# the "4 cited / 2 authoritative sources" gate even when citations were not the
# correct quality criterion.
