# Exact root cause:
#   _creation_pdf_qa(...) returns ONE list: issues
# but Publisher callers incorrectly did:
#   qa, issues = _creation_pdf_qa(...)
# An empty issue list therefore raised:
#   ValueError: not enough values to unpack (expected 2, got 0)
# This patch fixes BOTH evidence-mode and interpretive-mode Publisher paths.
