# NEMO 35.0 — UNIFIED MIND (Batch 1 + 2 in one)
#   1) ONE personal memory store (/root/nemo_memory.db) replaces the six parallel
#      fact extractors / context injectors added in v20.4, v25, v26, v27, v28, v32.
#      The old layers are NOT deleted (rollback safety); their memory functions are
#      re-bound below so they read/write the unified store. Old DBs are migrated on
#      first boot and left untouched.
#   2) /mind renders what Nemo knows about you as a graph image.
#   3) Smart auto-visual widened: compare / timeline / types / structure / how-to /
#      Hindi-Hinglish explain requests now earn a diagram, not only process flows.
#   Keys, secrets, connections, trading/shell/payment authority: UNCHANGED.
