# NEMO 43.1 — YT-DLP FRESHNESS + "PAGE NEEDS TO BE RELOADED" (hotfix)
#   Seen live after cookies were installed: "ERROR: [youtube] <id>: The page
#   needs to be reloaded." — that is NOT the bot-check; the cookies worked. It is
#   yt-dlp being older than YouTube's latest player change. The cure is always the
#   newest yt-dlp build (nightly pre-releases are on PyPI), then retry.
#   Fixes: (1) this error now triggers the ladder AND an on-the-spot upgrade to the
#   newest yt-dlp (stable → pre-release), reporting old→new version; (2) the ladder
#   gains "web" (best client WITH cookies) and "mweb"; (3) /video, /vdl, /ytdl,
#   /ytmp3 now route through the new media engine (one engine, not two);
#   (4) /media shows the installed yt-dlp version; /ytupdate forces an upgrade.
