#       (HLS) and web_embedded need no PO token; tv needs cookies; mweb needs a PO
#       token provider. The ladder now follows that table, and cookies are passed
#       ONLY to clients that use them (fewer rotations, fewer "invalid" warnings).
#     · cookie rotation is detected ("no longer valid") and explained once with the
#       private-window export tip — yt-dlp rewrites the cookie file after each run.
#   MEDIA LIBRARY (next big one): every download is indexed — title, source, kind,
#     size, Telegram file_id, date. /library [words] searches, /library send <id>
#     resends instantly (no download), /library drive <id> copies to Google Drive,
