# =============================================================================
# NEMO 52.0 — KERNEL 2.0 + AGENT MESH + BAYESIAN NERO + SAFE POWER HANDS
#
# A consolidation/reliability batch built on v51. This layer does not remove old
# capabilities. It adds a canonical execution envelope around Tool Fabric,
# validates tool arguments before execution, suppresses duplicate requests,
# preserves step-level evidence, supports safe read-only retry, upgrades NERO's
# model ranking with Bayesian/recent-performance evidence, adds an explicit
# specialist Agent Mesh, and introduces deterministic finance/business/ops hands.
#
# Safety and preservation invariants:
#   * no credential/config definition from v51 is changed or removed;
#   * no existing DB/table/file is dropped, truncated or renamed;
#   * all schema changes are CREATE TABLE/INDEX IF NOT EXISTS;
#   * high-risk or side-effect tools are never auto-retried;
#   * email/URL grounding stays under v48/v51 boundary rules;
#   * shell/browser/trading/payment authority remains on existing mature rails;
#   * model routing only reorders already-configured candidate model names;
#   * /mesh52 is advisory/research synthesis, not an authority bypass;
#   * operational diagnostics added here are read-only/metadata-only.
# =============================================================================
