# NEMO 53.0 — FIVE CORE FUSION (5 UPGRADES IN ONE)
#
#   UPGRADE 1 — KERNEL 3 CONSOLIDATION BRIDGE
#     Universal owner-message ingress ledger, one v53 dispatcher for new systems,
#     compatibility metrics, and a migration bridge toward one canonical kernel.
#     Legacy handlers stay intact until behavioral regression proves safe removal.
#
#   UPGRADE 2 — UNDERSTANDING 4.0 / LOCAL SEMANTIC BRAINSTEM
#     Lightweight local semantic prototype + learned-example classifier, Hinglish
#     aware tokenization, semantic tool adviser for SAFE/read-only tools only, and
#     inspectable context frames. LLM remains available for complex ambiguity.
#
#   UPGRADE 3 — MEMORY FABRIC 4.0 / EPISODIC + SALIENCE TIMELINE
#     Persistent episodic owner timeline with salience, project/thread linkage,
#     explicit high-value memory capture, lexical-semantic recall and provenance.
#     Existing Unified/Semantic/Photo/Thread memories are never deleted/replaced.
#
#   UPGRADE 4 — RESEARCH EVIDENCE GRAPH 2.0
#     Normalizes fresh search evidence, scores source authority, persists source
#     graph/run evidence, synthesizes only from supplied evidence, and exposes
#     disagreement/coverage instead of presenting raw search dumps as truth.
#
#   UPGRADE 5 — ACTION OS 5.0 / TOOL CONTRACTS + POSTCONDITIONS
#     Tool contracts add side-effect/idempotency/reversibility/retry/postcondition
#     metadata. Verified executions are postcondition-checked where observable and
#     can be downgraded to PARTIAL instead of claiming unsupported completion.
#
# Preservation / safety invariants:
#   * no credential/config definition from v52 is changed or removed;
#   * no existing DB/table/file is dropped, truncated, renamed or overwritten;
#   * schema changes are additive CREATE TABLE/INDEX IF NOT EXISTS only;
#   * semantic routing may auto-suggest/route LOW-risk read-only tools only;
#   * email/browser/shell/trading/payment authority remains on mature old rails;
#   * no hidden chain-of-thought is exposed; diagnostics show operational metadata;
#   * no exploit/bruteforce/evasion/credential-theft authority is added.
# =============================================================================
